=====================

`LICENSE` (Apache-2.0) covers the software in this repository. This file covers
the data: the HPN-QA benchmark, the evaluation outputs, and the aggregated
analysis outputs.

The data is not under a single licence, because not all of it is ours to
license. Read section 3 before redistributing.


